flowchart LR
    PR[(PR results)] --> Parse[Parse records]
    Base[(Baseline file or artifact)] --> Parse
    Inputs[Validate inputs] --> Analyze
    Parse --> Align[Pair by id]
    Align --> Stats[Paired statistics]
    Stats --> Analyze[Verdict per metric]
    Analyze --> Report[Markdown report]
    Report --> Summary([Job summary])
    Report --> Comment([PR comment])
    Analyze --> Outputs([Step outputs])
